<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK STATS BUREAU SEES 5.6PCT 97 REAL GDP GROWTH.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK STATS BUREAU SEES 5.6PCT 97 REAL GDP GROWTH.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Statistical Bureau on Wednesday said it expected real GDP growth for 1997 of 5.6 percent year-on-year, compared to 6.9 percent in 1996.</p>
</text>
